WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:05.467
The camera view puts the answer right under your webcam.

00:06.233 --> 00:10.533
You read it while looking at the camera. Light or dark, any size, any opacity.

00:11.300 --> 00:14.433
It is hidden from screen sharing, so only you can see it.

00:15.200 --> 00:18.533
Keyboard shortcuts show it, hide it, and scroll long answers.
